I checked. The dealer checked too. On sixth street you caught 2♣, and the dealer caught K♥, so the dealer bets 10. I called, so the pot is 60 and your count is 950. Seventh street is next. The dealer checks, and it's your move: check or bet 10. Earlier I said the dealer had bet on fifth street, which was wrong. No bet was made there, and the figures above are correct from this point on.

